  "review": {
    "book": "2SA",
    "entityID": "person:zadok_2973",
    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "2SA 8:17",
        "textualBasisJa": "Zadok the son of Ahitub and Ahimelech the son of Abiathar were priests, Seraiah was scribe,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 15:24",
        "textualBasisJa": "Behold, Zadok also came, and all the Levites with him, bearing the ark of the covenant of God; and they set down God’s ark; and Abiathar went up until all the people finished passing out of the city."
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 15:25",
        "textualBasisJa": "The king said to Zadok, “Carry God’s ark back into the city. If I find favor in the LORD’s eyes, he will bring me again, and show me both it and his habitation;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 15:27",
        "textualBasisJa": "The king said also to Zadok the priest, “Aren’t you a seer? Return into the city in peace, and your two sons with you, Ahimaaz your son and Jonathan the son of Abiathar."
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 15:29",
        "textualBasisJa": "Zadok therefore and Abiathar carried God’s ark to Jerusalem again; and they stayed there."
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 15:35",
        "textualBasisJa": "Don’t you have Zadok and Abiathar the priests there with you? Therefore whatever you hear out of the king’s house, tell it to Zadok and Abiathar the priests."
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 15:36",
        "textualBasisJa": "Behold, they have there with them their two sons, Ahimaaz, Zadok’s son, and Jonathan, Abiathar’s son. Send to me everything that you shall hear by them.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 17:15",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then Hushai said to Zadok and to Abiathar the priests, “Ahithophel counseled Absalom and the elders of Israel that way; and I have counseled this way."
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 18:19",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then Ahimaaz the son of Zadok said, “Let me now run and carry the king news, how the LORD has avenged him of his enemies.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 18:22",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then Ahimaaz the son of Zadok said yet again to Joab, “But come what may, please let me also run after the Cushite.” Joab said, “Why do you want to run, my son, since you will have no reward for the news?”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 18:27",
        "textualBasisJa": "The watchman said, “I think the running of the first one is like the running of Ahimaaz the son of Zadok.” The king said, “He is a good man, and comes with good news.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 19:11",
        "textualBasisJa": "King David sent to Zadok and to Abiathar the priests, saying, “Speak to the elders of Judah, saying, ‘Why are you the last to bring the king back to his house, since the speech of all Israel has come to the king, to return him to his house?"
      },
      {
        "ref": "2SA 20:25",
        "textualBasisJa": "Sheva was scribe, Zadok and Abiathar were priests,"
      }
    ],
